# Cut profile czt: the CZT plane under the 4 cm target (16 pixels of 2.5 cm, each read out alone), with the measured TOF.
# Chosen by hand on 2026-11-02 and optimised for the Al L_alpha peak the same day (the work folder's
# output/muonic_xray_czt/pixel_tof/cut_optimization.C, the counting significance under the peak); kept for the 60-day
# runs of Al and Si. A cut keeps lo <= value <= hi; "-" is an open side (analysis/CutProfile.h).
# variable     lo       hi
track           -        8
zenith          -       35
topE          1.6      3.5
midE          1.6        -
tkin           10       80
entryE          -      600
otherE          -      0.6
npix            -        4
